    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d390">

                <pb facs="0489" n="401" xml:id="pg401"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/732</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">White</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-01-11">January 11, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Brazilian Ambassador telephoned to say that he was instructed by his
                    Government to express the thanks of the Brazilian Government for our support in
                    Lima of the Brazilian proposal.</p>
                <closer><signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">rancis</hi>] W[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">hite</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
